# An allowlist: the image is built from these files only. Everything else stays out of
# the build context: .venv, .env files, tests and their cassettes, evals (cassettes-raw,
# the .spend ledger files), caches.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!src/
!profiles/

# Inside src/ (a later line wins over the allowlist above).
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.egg-info

# Never, wherever they appear, even if the allowlist above grows.
**/.venv
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.env
**/cassettes-raw
**/.spend*
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
